Description:
{Galorpian + Galorpian} 
Why are you purple?
Once per turn, you may equip 1 Galorpian Equipment from your hand or Waste Repository to a Galorpian creature you control. That creature gains +1 ATK and +1 HP.

{Cat + Bunny}
If this creature doesn’t attack: Restore 1 HP to it at end phase.
Your opponent can only attack creatures with the name 'Bunny' or fusions which have splices named 'bunny' while this card is on the field.
